      "@type": "Question",
      name: "Is Birmingham accepting new private hire driver applications?",
      acceptedAnswer: {
        "@type": "Answer",
        text: "The council's applications page carries a notice stating that new driver applications are not being accepted unless the applicant has already completed a medical and obtained a DBS certificate through its occupational health service. That notice has been on the page for some time, so confirm the current position with licensing before you spend money.",
